<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally higher on fairly good demand and mostly moderate offerings.  Select and Choice loin cuts higher, round cuts firm, and the Select rib and chuck cuts firm, but the Choice rib and chuck cuts steady.  Beef trimmings higher on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>304 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 73 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>18 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     103.32	103.73	 98.27	 97.53</p>
<p>Changes	   0.77	  1.26	  1.12	  1.38</p>
<p>Rib	  163.36	163.41	156.16	156.48</p>
<p>Chuck	 67.63	 67.18	 69.13	 66.56</p>
<p>Round	 87.40	 87.40	 84.97	 84.97</p>
<p>Loin	 168.50	171.07	149.05	149.00</p>
<p>Brisket     61.68	 61.68	 60.53	 60.53</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  66.99	 66.90	 67.23	 67.05</p>
<p>Flank	 59.06	 59.06	 59.24	 59.24</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
